ile": null}, {"sha": "6a20faae14fca0667f24ef6f7c366da13be5b9ed", "message": "Removing demo vue stuff, cleaning nav bar", "created_at": "2023-04-07T23:42:02Z", "repo": "vue-navbar", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "31ba67127ff39839c70cec4ab4c3715057ed31c5", "message": "Adding props for menu config", "created_at": "2023-04-07T23:26:21Z", "repo": "vue-navbar", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7e2126409f32a69def6257ce951eb0b265232728", "message": "First commit", "created_at": "2023-04-07T11:05:08Z", "repo": "vue-navbar", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42586564e239c86ff050886023f24bef86bd25ad", "message": "init", "created_at": "2023-04-07T10:56:49Z", "repo": "vue-navbar", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1e376e0c160778b3b5bced2ecc75a0bcef74510a", "message": "Update screenshot to show new Gantt chart UI", "created_at": "2026-03-15T22:48:18Z", "repo": "vue3-scheduler", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "22d0cd40c4b7d5f601326f6495528e687245f99f", "message": "Rewrite README with full API reference, architecture docs, and theming guide\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-15T22:46:08Z", "repo": "vue3-scheduler", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fe978b40dd0c2ef5b0f4ad04ff32298708a03fa7", "message": "Rewrite as interactive Gantt chart with dependency arrows, groups, and theming\n\nReplace the two broken VueScheduler components (V1 string-dates, V2 with\nnon-functional drag/resize) with a fully decomposed Gantt chart built on\nVue 3 <script setup>, composables, and proper TypeScript types.\n\nNew architecture:\n- GanttChart (root) -> GanttSidebar, GanttTimeline, GanttGrid\n- GanttGrid -> GanttEventBar, GanttDependencyLines, GanttCurrentTimeLine, GanttHoverLine\n- Composables: useTimeline (pixel math, zoom), useInteract (drag/resize via InteractJS), useScrollSync\n\nFeatures added:\n- SVG dependency arrows between linked events\n- Progress bars, milestones (diamond markers), multi-level timeline headers\n- Collapsible row groups with recursive deep nesting\n- Left+right edge resize, click-to-create, keyboard nav, event selection\n- CSS variable theming (6 built-in themes), scroll-to-today\n- Full interactive demo with tabbed options panel (display, dates, events,\n  rows, theme, presets) and 4 dataset presets\n\nBugs fixed from V2: broken resize (used string regex on Date objects),\nno-op drag listener, no Vue emits, window.dragMoveListener pollution,\ninteractjs in devDependencies, no cleanup on unmount.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-15T22:44:16Z", "repo": "vue3-scheduler", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d48f2e9f314d935b7ac75d6ccb92106f3c7c234d", "message": "Update README.md\n\nRemoving the cringe", "created_at": "2024-03-07T01:18:26Z", "repo": "vue3-scheduler", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8db19b2e09aa556d7a310ec60f50b6c5f6a38e0a", "message": "Refactoring", "created_at": "2024-02-21T01:46:25Z", "repo": "vue3-scheduler", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9948d6c5e7ef63cb3c3f00ec9038432526db5fa4", "message": "Refactoring", "created_at": "2024-02-21T00:39:51Z", "repo": "vue3-scheduler", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b6e2e873ac3f1af18757d70e8fa80c138b80ce48", "message": "Refactoring schedule", "created_at": "2024-02-20T07:08:15Z", "repo": "vue3-scheduler", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8fb3be299f448ad5f714e26ec78b6e9b155eed4f", "message": "Refactoring draggable init", "created_at": "2024-02-18T05:09:46Z", "repo